        "node_id": "n_3_d01bce",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is correct in its logic but fails to account for the possibility of buying multiple microtransactions of the same type on the same day. The priority queue should consider the cumulative effect of buying multiple items on the same day, rather than processing each sale individually. This oversight leads to incorrect calculations when multiple microtransactions are available for sale on the same day.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
